  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Right to Pay Equity and Childcare in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote better working conditions for women through policy and legal change, and community organizing and advocacy in the private education and health sectors. The project will move towards implementation of gender responsive legal reform achieved in the previous phase, promote gender responsive human resources practices, including expanding childcare facilities in Jordan to create an enabling environment for working parents to manage family and work responsibilities.</narrative>
  </description>
